WEBVTT

NOTE Narration is displayed in the caption strip below the video by default.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.382
The fictional worker cannot access the approved tool and fears looking resistant.

00:00:05.382 --> 00:00:08.522
The recipient needs a timely accurate result.

00:00:08.522 --> 00:00:14.352
The reviewer faces a deadline but needs clear responsibility for every checked draft.

00:00:14.352 --> 00:00:22.874
Include the temporary worker with the least authority: where can this person ask a question or report a problem?

00:00:22.874 --> 00:00:25.116
Introduce the unresolved access concern.

00:00:25.116 --> 00:00:28.256
Continuing would lead to informal account sharing.

00:00:28.256 --> 00:00:32.741
Use the approved AI request and read the challenge first.

00:00:32.741 --> 00:00:36.329
Justify your own decision before asking for revisions.

00:00:36.329 --> 00:00:41.711
If AI skips the question, ask it to wait for your justification.

00:00:41.711 --> 00:00:46.644
Record the competing needs and which reaction came from which source.

00:00:46.644 --> 00:00:48.887
These teaching reactions are simulated.

00:00:48.887 --> 00:00:52.026
They do not establish actual staff acceptance.

00:00:52.026 --> 00:00:58.305
In your project, retain authorized human feedback when available without copying unnecessary private details.
